{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MineDeeper gives Minesweeper a whole new dimension in a fresh and trippy way. Below the field lie an <strong>endless amount of new layers</strong> to solve, that support your run by clearing upper layers for <strong>less 50/50 situations</strong>.<strong>\u00a0</strong>But the deeper you go, the harder it gets: use all layers to your advantage to defuse any roadblock. How deep can you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/extras/c83d4f42dca64ba402cfc509e6817c83.poster.avif?t=1761905660\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/extras/c83d4f42dca64ba402cfc509e6817c83.webm?t=1761905660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/extras/c83d4f42dca64ba402cfc509e6817c83.mp4?t=1761905660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parallax visuals</strong> give you a better sense of depth  (Can be disabled in the options)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give it a try for yourself and enjoy!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"MineNovice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104630/dd7f1439892b12e94afa845894a49c35f9e24cfc.jpg"},{"name":"MineApprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104630/9454b285ac4249af83f33d9bcc31645764114c55.jpg"},{"name":"MineAdept","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104630/ec6b47436c739f06c003f5ba5250fdd9906d9727.jpg"},{"name":"MineExpert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104630/82e64b70a2bc2a6784087707ef22e4509484ddb7.jpg"},{"name":"MineMaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co